      "prompt": "# Core Summary\nA 5-second cinematic text animation set against a deep black void, featuring three lines of white, handwritten-style Chinese text appearing sequentially with 35mm film grain and subtle light leaks. Continuous shot. The first line fades in with a slight jitter, followed rapidly by the second and third lines, culminating in a full display of the philosophical message before fading.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nDeep black background with high-contrast 35mm film grain overlay. Subtle dust particles float slowly in the void, illuminated by a faint, unseen top light source. A soft, warm vignette borders the frame. No physical architecture or terrain.\n**Audio Description**: Low-frequency ambient hum, subtle film projector mechanical noise, silence otherwise.\n\n# Subjects Description\nNone. The primary visual elements are the text lines themselves, styled as handwritten white characters with slight imperfections.\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nThe frame begins pure black. At 00:00, the first line of text `\"最烂的剧本，往往有最好的演员。\"` writes itself onto the center screen in a crooked, white handwritten font, appearing as if drawn by an invisible pen with slight jitter. By 00:01.5, the second line `\"演员：你。\"` snaps in below the first, slightly smaller and sharper. At 00:02.5, the third line `\"评分：无法评分，因为人生不需要。\"` fades in beneath the second, completing the stanza. The camera holds static on the full text arrangement. A subtle light leak flickers across the right edge at 00:04. The text remains visible until the clip ends, with film grain continuously shifting over the black background.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\nMonochromatic palette with deep blacks and bright white text. High-contrast film noir aesthetic. 35mm film grain, slight chromatic aberration on text edges, and organic dust textures create a tactile, analog movie feel. Lighting is minimal, focusing entirely on the legibility of the text against the void.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\nIntrospective, melancholic, and philosophical. The darkness and grain evoke a sense of nostalgia and seriousness, while the message delivers a poignant, empowering twist about the nature of life and self-agency.",
