    {
      "prompt_id": 36,
      "seed": 59526,
      "prompt": "# Core Summary\nA 5-second cinematic product showcase for \"超能植愈香氛洗衣液\" (Chaoneng Plant Healing Fragrance Laundry Detergent), blending macro ingredient artistry with a heroic product reveal. The clip uses a two-shot structure: first, an extreme close-up of natural ingredients swirling in liquid to establish the \"plant healing\" concept; second, a polished medium shot of the 2.8kg bottle with dynamic lighting and key selling point text overlays. The visual style mimics high-end perfume commercials with luminous, layered lighting and fluid motion.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:02]\nA macro studio environment with a shallow depth of field. The background is a soft, out-of-focus bokeh of natural greens and warm golds. A pool of pearlescent, viscous liquid fills the lower frame, catching directional sunlight that creates caustic reflections. Floating on the surface are delicate French Iris petals and small chips of sandalwood.\n\n[shot2][00:02-00:05]\nA clean, minimalist product stage with a textured stone pedestal in the center. The background is a gradient of soft white to pale sage green, illuminated by volumetric light beams (Tyndall effect) cutting through a subtle mist. The lighting is bright and high-key, casting sharp but soft shadows to emphasize the bottle's contours.\n\n# Subjects Description\n- **Product**: A 2.8kg large capacity bottle of \"超能植愈香氛洗衣液\". The bottle design is sleek, featuring a translucent green-tinted plastic body showing the liquid inside, with a premium white and gold label. The cap is a sturdy, ergonomic pump or screw top in dark green or wood texture.\n- **Ingredients**: Visual representations of French Iris (pale purple/white petals), Sandalwood (brown woody chips), and a swirl of green-gold liquid detergent.\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:02]\nExtreme close-up. Slow motion. French Iris petals and sandalwood chips gently drop into the pearlescent green liquid, creating a viscous, satisfying ripple effect. Light refracts through the liquid swirls, highlighting the texture of the natural oils. The motion is fluid and hypnotic, emphasizing the \"100% natural plant精油\" concept. Sound of a soft liquid splash and a delicate chime.\n\n[shot2][00:02-00:05]\nCut to medium shot. The 2.8kg bottle stands firmly on the stone pedestal. A beam of light sweeps across the label from left to right, making the gold text gleam. Soft mist swirls around the base of the bottle. White text fades in elegantly on the right side: `\"Yves Cassar 专属调香\"` followed by `\"720h 持久留香\"`. The bottle remains static while the light and mist create dynamic movement. Sound of a low, luxurious bass swell and a subtle wind whoosh.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\n- **Visual Style**: High-end commercial cinematography, resembling luxury perfume advertisements.\n- **Color Palette**: Dominant sage greens, pearlescent whites, and accents of gold and pale purple.\n- **Lighting**: Bright, luminous, and layered. Use of rim lighting to separate the bottle from the background. Volumetric haze for atmosphere.\n- **Texture**: Emphasis on fluid viscosity, petal delicacy, and smooth plastic/glass surfaces.\n- **Quality**: High resolution, sharp focus on product details, smooth motion blur for liquid elements.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\n- **Atmosphere**: Fresh, luxurious, natural, and serene.\n- **Emotion**: Trust in quality, sensory pleasure, and premium elegance. The clip aims to evoke the feeling of a high-end spa or garden through visual cues.",
